"brand_evasion": "While active, the next Orb only works with Evasion modifiers: it only adds Evasion modifiers, and Severance, Absolution, Recasting and Anchoring only pick Evasion modifiers. Stack Brands to narrow further. Consumed when used.",
"brand_explosive": "While active, the next Orb only works with Explosive modifiers: it only adds Explosive modifiers, and Severance, Absolution, Recasting and Anchoring only pick Explosive modifiers. Stack Brands to narrow further. Consumed when used.",
